========================================================================
  non-peak optima tested: 14176
  optima with NO complement (two-sided) binder: 0
  optima with NO sum-type binding pair:          0
  Proof: a one-sided binder set is improvable (shift tau to raise every
         binder's ||.|| while non-binders stay > M) => contradiction with
         maximality. So +M and -M binders coexist => (a+b)tau* in Z.
